      "title": "Uncontrolled Resource Consumption in org.yaml:snakeyaml",
      "description": "Affected versions of org.yaml:snakeyaml are vulnerable to Improper Restriction of Recursive Entity References in DTDs ('XML Entity Expansion') / Uncontrolled Resource Consumption. SnakeYAML is vulnerable to a Denial of Service attack when processing deeply nested YAML collections. Without a nested depth limit, a maliciously crafted YAML input could overwhelm the parser with excessive nesting, leading to significant resource exhaustion and potential service disruption.",
